    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［01/25 澄まし］おにいちゃん、明日の癒やし家電コーナー、最後に確認してもいい？",
      "expressionId": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "澄まし",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "am",
          "src": "images/assets/char/am_moe/standing/am_moe_expression_01_composed.webp",
